{"4221100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anarchy School", "steam_appid": 4221100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i><strong> Anarchy School,</strong></i> you will find yourself in a fictional middle school located somewhere in Finland, of all places. In Graveschool, formerly known as Braveschool, you must uncover dirty secrets from the school and town's past and overthrow the new principal. But what do Nazis have to do with all of this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221100/extras/fa9023a2387ae3197a363da35423372c.avif?t=1769861108\" width=800 height=605 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anarchy School is a first-person action-adventure game set in a Finnish middle school. Avoid hallway supervisors, fight bullies with anything from sharp pencils to lighters, and meet dozens of weird and colorful characters as you progress through 17 voice-acted episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be the same after your visit to Graveschool...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221100/extras/92f62574274e043ec25b1c6691bd74c0.avif?t=1769861108\" width=792 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice-acted story with 17 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of fun weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear activities: loot lockers, avoid faculty, find collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, gore, poo, and mayhem!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i><strong> Anarchy School,</strong></i> y